<%- include('partials/header') %>

<main>
    <h1><%= title %></h1>

    <p>
        Our service projects provide opportunities for volunteers to use
        their time and skills to support meaningful causes and strengthen
        communities.
    </p>

    <h2>Available Service Projects</h2>

    <ul>
        <li>
            <h2>Community Cleanup</h2>

            <p>
                Join volunteers in cleaning and improving shared community
                spaces while promoting environmental responsibility and
                community pride.
            </p>
        </li>

        <li>
            <h2>Educational Support</h2>

            <p>
                Help students and learners through tutoring, mentoring,
                educational activities, and access to useful learning
                resources.
            </p>
        </li>

        <li>
            <h2>Community Outreach</h2>

            <p>
                Support local communities by participating in activities
                that provide assistance to individuals and families who need
                additional support.
            </p>
        </li>

        <li>
            <h2>Health and Wellness Awareness</h2>

            <p>
                Participate in activities that encourage healthy lifestyles,
                wellness education, and greater awareness of physical and
                emotional well-being.
            </p>
        </li>
    </ul>
</main>

